# Knacks: every part's named knack as a sewn badge on the pet details (tap to read) and the best one
# on the shelf cards' corners. Nothing shows before parts open; a knack for something you haven't got
# yet (fever before the lights, automation before its tab) stays hidden until it opens. Your active
# pet's knacks feed the boosts (the log). Everything stays inside the window.
from after_tutorial
view full
tab collection
wait 1
expect no-text "lucky paws"          # the cat's knack: parts aren't open yet
expect no-text "wishing star"
expect fits
shot before_parts
unlock feature:parts
dress body=bunny palette=toxic pattern=stars eyes=cyclops accessory=crown finish=holo
pets 12
tab home
tab collection
wait 1
click MiniCard#1                     # your active pet on the cushion: its shelf opens with it chosen
wait 1
expect text "wishing star"           # the best badge is read first (epic stars, holo: +30% luck)
expect text "+30% luck"
expect text "pattern: stars"
expect no-text "glow in the dark"    # fever: not before the lights are fixed
expect no-text "royal"               # automation: not before its tab opens
expect fits
shot grid
click KnackBadge#3
wait 1
expect text "one big eye"
expect text "+30% spotting"
expect text "eyes: cyclops"
shot badge
boosts
fix wires
wait 1.5
click KnackBadge#2
wait 1
expect text "glow in the dark"
expect text "fever 45% longer"
unlock tab:automation
wait 1.5
click KnackBadge#5
wait 1
expect text "royal"
expect text "automation 60% faster"
expect fits
shot all_badges
boosts
click MiniCard#2
wait 1
expect fits
shot other_pet
